# Project vocabulary

Use these names in discussions, plans, test reports, and documentation. Prefer the role name over the ambiguous word "bot" when more than one role could be meant.

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Builder** | Agent that interviews the business owner, proposes business facts for approval, and creates or updates the approved business configuration. |
| **Business Bot** | Customer-facing bot configured from the approved business information. Answers customers; does not modify business facts. |

Do not rename code or change implementation solely to match this vocabulary.
